--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Gradle build files under mod/ (build.gradle.kts, settings.gradle.kts,
gradle.properties, dependencies.gradle, repositories.gradle, gtnhShared/, the
Gradle wrapper) come from the GT New Horizons mod template
(https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/ExampleMod1.7.10), which is under the MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2021 Johann Bernhardt.

This repository contains no content of the GT New Horizons modpack. The item
table, recipe book, quest book, guide pages, icons and textures that the brain
reads (brain/packdata/) are generated on your own machine from your own copy of
the client pack and are not part of this repository; they stay under the
licenses of their authors.
